<title>SOUTH AFRICA: South Africa's Manuel to address routine news briefing.</title>
<headline>South Africa's Manuel to address routine news briefing.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African Finance Minister Trevor Manuel is to hold a news conference at 1000 GMT on Tuesday, officials said.</p>
<p>Manuel is meeting reporters in one of series of routine briefings by African National Congress ministers to wrap up the parliamentary session, which ends on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
